 1.3\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the king's knight (60%), landing on e5, d5, f5.","Aim at their bishop: it is behind 21% of their lost leads, 1.3\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the dark-squared bishop (55%). The reply wins it outright 40% of the time. Take it with a bishop.","Material changes hands for you on d5 and f7: build pressure there.","They win material on e5 and d4: keep those squares defended.","Look for the queen fork: it appears 2.6\u00d7 as often as usual in this opening."],"similar":[],"family":"King's Pawn Game"}